{
    "version": "1.1.17",
    "description": "基于 IntelliJ 平台的开源 Git 图形客户端（JetBrains 独立 Git 客户端的开源重制版），保留 IDEA CE 完整 git 功能。",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/DetachHead/rebased",
    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/DetachHead/rebased/releases/download/1.1.17/rebased.win.zip",
            "hash": "20ad1b6733c091f896fcca299824f5a12afb60ba53ea2196c8b3fdb48b81c4d2"
        }
    },
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "bin\\rebased64.exe",
            "Rebased"
        ]
    ],
    "persist": [
        "bin\\idea.properties",
        "bin\\rebased64.exe.vmoptions"
    ],
    "portableProfile": {
        "mappings": [
            {
                "label": "roaming",
                "source": "AppData/JetBrains/IdeaIC1.1",
                "target": "$persist_dir/roaming",
                "strategy": "symlink",
                "ensureTarget": true
            }
        ],
        "options": {
            "module": "scripts/portable.psm1",
            "log": true
        }
    },
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/DetachHead/rebased"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/DetachHead/rebased/releases/download/$version/rebased.win.zip",
                "hash": {
                    "mode": "download"
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "notes": [
        "官方便携 zip（根目录平铺布局，区别于 extras 桶的安装器解包版）；比 extras 多了 roaming 映射的完全便携化——%APPDATA%\\JetBrains\\IdeaIC1.1（product-info.json 的 dataDirectoryName 实测）指向 persist/roaming。",
        "IDE 的应用内更新会下载补丁并运行安装器改写安装目录，可能破坏 scoop 版本目录结构——有更新提示时走 scoop update rebased，勿点应用内。"
    ]
}
